@bank all
// FX28 (2026-10-26, the user's playtest notes: "crew chatter about how fast you got offered the test"; lead 38's plan
// A-C). 24p's promoTalkTick says one in a bubble, from someone near you, each person once a beat a day: in the Works
// bay and at meals (the evening's talk anywhere). Kinds: pb.soon (from the offer: how fast, by days aboard), pb.luck
// (friends: the evening before and the test morning), pb.watch (you at your test job, in the bay), pb.passed (the test
// done, the result not yet given), pb.officer (the day you're made Officer). Spoken over heads: 60 characters or fewer.
// Drafted by FX28 for SW2 to polish (they/them for you, or your name; never a guess).

== pb.soon
? day:-9
- Your Tier 2 test? You've been aboard nine days.
- Not even ten days aboard. Calder must rate you.
? day:-9 dept:works
- Nine days and up for Tier 2. Took me three months.   #funny
? day:10-14
- Up for Tier 2 inside two weeks. That's quick.
- Under two weeks aboard and a Tier 2 test. Not bad.
- Two weeks? Calder doesn't hurry for anyone. Usually.   #funny
? day:15-
- Tier 2 test, then. About time, if you ask me.
- Heard Calder's put you up for Tier 2. Good.
?
- Heard you've got your Tier 2 test. Already?
- A Tier 2 test. Don't let anyone tell you it's hard.   #funny
- Calder doesn't put just anyone up for Tier 2.
? dept:works
- Your test's a scrubber, I bet. It's always a scrubber.   #funny
- Tier 2 means the scrubbers. You'll hear them in your sleep.
? act:meal
- Eat up. Big day coming, I hear.
- So you're the one with the Tier 2 test. Everyone's saying.

== pb.luck
? tier>=friend
- Good luck tomorrow. Not that you need it.   #warm
- Sleep early tonight. You've got a test.
- Tomorrow's the day, then. You'll be fine.   #warm
? tier>=friend time:morning
- Today's the day. You've got this.   #warm
- Eat something. Tests go better on porridge.   #funny
- Good luck. I'll want to hear all about it.   #warm

== pb.watch
? dept:works
- Don't mind us. We're not watching. Much.   #funny
- Steady hands. You're doing fine.
- Calder's watching. Don't look at Calder.   #funny
?
- That's the test job, isn't it? Good luck.
- Quiet, everyone. Test in progress.   #funny

== pb.passed
? tier>=friend
- Done? How did it go? Tell me everything.   #warm
- I bet you passed. I'd bet my pudding on it.   #funny
- Results tomorrow? I'll be waiting. Tell me first.   #warm
?
- Heard you did your Tier 2 test. How was it?
- Calder's face gives nothing away, does it?   #funny
? dept:works
- Tidy job on that scrubber. Saw it on the board.
- She'll tell you tomorrow. She likes to make you wait.   #funny

== pb.officer
? tier>=friend
- Officer! I knew it. I said so. Ask anyone.   #warm
- Your own cabin tonight. I'm coming to see it.   #funny
?
- Congratulations, Officer.
- The pip's this afternoon, I hear. With the Captain.
? time:evening
- Your own cabin tonight, I hear. Lucky you.
